  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nAuditor - Benton County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Clear · 45°\n \n \n\n Bid Notices\n Calendar\n Courts\n Employment\n FAQ\n \n\n Translate Language\n \n Translate\n \n \n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nBenton\nCounty · Iowa\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Home\n \n\n Departments \n \n \n\n Assessor\n Attorney\n Auditor\n Board of Supervisors\n Conservation\n Emergency Management\n Environmental Health\n Human Resources\n IT/GIS\n Land Use\n Public Health\n Recorder\n Roadside Management\n Secondary Roads\n Sheriff\n Social Services\n Solid Waste/Landfill\n Transportation\n Treasurer\n Veterans Affairs & General Assistance\n Weed Commission\n \n \n \n\n About \n \n \n\n Cemeteries\n Communities\n Elected Officials\n School Districts\n Township Information\n \n \n Contact\n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n Benton County Employees: If you need a 1095 printed for your records, please go to the Human Resource Page.Human Resource Page \n\n\n\n \n\n \nDepartments\n \n\nAuditor \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n Benton County Courthouse\n \n111 E. 4th St. · 2nd Floor\n\n Vinton, IA 52349 \nDriving Directions\n \n Mailing Address\n \nPO Box 549\n\n Vinton, IA 52349\n Contact Information\n \n(319) 472-2365 \n(319) 472-3692 (Fax) \n Hours\n \nMonday thru Friday\n \n8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\n\n Holiday Closures \n \n\n \n \n\n \n \n\n About the Auditor\n \n \n\n \n \n\n Alcohol & Tobacco Licenses\n \n \n\n \n \n\n Elections Website\n \n \n\n \n \n\n Financial & Budgets\n \n \n\n \n \n\n Property Search\n \n \n\n \nOur goals in serving the citizens of Benton County: \n \n \n \nTo provide accurate and reliable financial records, with full and complete disclosure of the county’s finances. \n \nTo preserve integrity and fairness in the election process. \n \nTo provide efficient and knowledgeable service to the citizens of Benton County, and be a key resource for information about Benton County. \n \n \n\n \n\n \nOur Team\n \n \nHayley Rippel, County Auditor\n \nGina Edler, Elections Deputy\n \nJacob Golstine, Real Estate Clerk\n \nAlyce Lynch, Auditor Clerk\n \nAlisha Burmeister, Payroll Deputy\n \n \n \n \nOur Location\n \n\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \nBenton County Courthouse\n\n 111 E 4th Street\n\n Vinton, IA 52349\n \n\n \nContact Us\n Upcoming Holidays\n\n Department Hours May Vary\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Benton County, Iowa | Title VI: Policy Statement · Complaint Form | Privacy Policy\n \npowered by \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeteran's Day · November 11, 2026\n \nThanksgiving · November 26, 2026\n \nDay After Thanksgiving · November 27, 2026\n \nChristmas Eve · December 24, 2026\n \nChristmas Day · December 25, 2026\n \nNew Years Day · January 1, 2027\n \n\n\n\n"
